# W32, host a (k10, flag 20: the Fortress open): hosts Death Valley and walks stag0101 -> staggf01 -> staggf02 -> staggf04
# along kExits' Fortress edges (stag0101 matz01, staggf01 matz01, staggf02 matz02): the Fortress is fields of Death
# Valley (decision 39), so the instance goes on, no area_escape. (The trial merge's explore bot fell in staggf04 on the way
# on to stag0205's plateau, so the scenario stops at staggf04.)
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@80
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log a hosts
explore matz01 yes until stage=staggf01,control
explore matz01 yes until stage=staggf02,control
explore matz02 yes until stage=staggf04,control
log a deep in the Fortress
idle until frames>=300
log a done
